{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01787","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难二首 一 · 高适","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见富家翁，昔时贫贱谁比数。\n一朝金多结豪贵，万事胜人健如虎。\n子孙成长满眼前，妻能管弦妾能舞。\n自矜一朝忽如此，却笑傍人独悲苦。\n东邻少年安所如，席门穷巷出无车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}